# TOEIC Vocabulary Day59

| 단어 | 의미 | 예문 |
|---|---|---|
| proposal | 제안서, 제안 | The manager reviewed the proposal. |
| decision | 결정 | We need to make a decision. |
| responsibility | 책임 | This is your responsibility. |
| department | 부서 | She works in the sales department. |
| colleague | 동료 | I discussed the issue with my colleague. |
| applicant | 지원자 | Each applicant must submit a resume. |
| position | 직책, 직위 | The company has an open position. |
| opportunity | 기회 | This is a great career opportunity. |
| feedback | 피드백 | We received positive feedback. |
| performance | 성과, 업무 수행 | The manager evaluated his performance. |

### 암기 포인트

- submit a proposal: 제안서를 제출하다
- make a decision: 결정을 내리다
- take responsibility for: ~에 책임을 지다
- sales department: 영업 부서
- open position: 공석, 채용 직위
- career opportunity: 경력 기회
- receive feedback: 피드백을 받다
- evaluate performance: 성과를 평가하다
